        "fun": "Growlithe is loyal and fearless, barking at, biting and chasing off any threat to its Trainer or territory, even far bigger foes, and otherwise waiting motionless for orders. Its nose never forgets a scent and can even smell emotions. Its bones have been found in Stone Age ruins, and it's modelled on the shisa, the lion-dog guardian statues of Japan.",
