      "description": {
        "fun": "Arcanine can run 10,000 km in a single day, so gracefully it seems to fly, and anyone who hears its bark is said to grovel before it. In China it's revered as a Legendary Pokémon, and its official category is literally 'Legendary Pokémon', though it isn't one. Like Growlithe, it's based on the shisa, the lion-dog guardians of Japanese folklore.",
        "guide": "The evolution of Growlithe with a Fire Stone, a large, majestic dog-like Fire Pokémon admired for its beauty and speed. It is brave and loyal, and in some places it is revered as a Legendary Pokémon. Its Hisuian form is a Fire and Rock type with a rocky mane and horn.",
